#==============================================================================================
#
#   svg_path_paintable - Painting::SVGPathPaintable: the paintable of a shape, a path or text
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/SVGPathPaintable.cpp (lines 1-229) and SVGPathPaintable.h:
#       creation, the computed path layout gives it, the bounds it adds to a clip path, hit
#       testing, and painting: the geometry alone for a clip path
#       (https://drafts.fxtf.org/css-masking/#ClipPathElement), otherwise the fill and the
#       stroke in paint-order, with paint servers or colors.
